* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/əˈmiː.ɡəʊ/}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-amigo.wav|Audio (Southern England)}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|en|/əˈmiɡoʊ/}}

===Noun===
{{head|en|noun|plural|amigos|feminine|amiga}}

# {{lb|en|informal}} A [[friend]].
#: {{syn|en|Thesaurus:friend}}
